2. **No Code Copying or Plagiarism**: You may not copy, duplicate, clone, replicate, hotlink, republish, or paste any portion of this codebase, algorithms, API endpoints, schema definitions, spatial tracking protocols, or database structures.
3. **No Derivative Works or Forks**: You may not create, compile, distribute, publish, or sublicense any derivative works, modified builds, forks, plugins, or complementary extensions derived from this codebase.
4. **No Pipeline or Model Integration**: You may not extract or integrate any subcomponents of VajraNetra—including the 3D Digital Twin engine, IoU gear binding models, temporal skeletal fall keypoint classifiers, optical flame detectors, or automated OSHA Form 301 PDF generators—into third-party applications, commercial bots, security software, or API gateways.
5. **No Commercial Exploitation**: You may not sell, lease, rent, license, sub-license, commercialize, or use this software, models, or documentation to generate direct or indirect revenue.
6. **No Asset or UI Theft**: You may not reuse any visual assets, logos, 3D Digital Twin components, design systems, UI components, animations, color palettes, or branding elements created for VajraNetra.
7. **No Reverse Engineering or Penetration Attacks**: You may not reverse-engineer, decompile, disassemble, or extract algorithms/parameters from the backend services or client-side modules. You are strictly forbidden from performing penetration testing, vulnerability scanning, fuzzing, or DDoS/DoS simulations against active VajraNetra infrastructure.
